+ * apps SMMU: the GPI stream must reach physical memory untranslated. The
+ * Qualcomm hypervisor that owns this SMMU turns an S2CR BYPASS write into
+ * FAULT (s0095 read back 0x20000, then the first DMA crashed the phone into
+ * crash-dump mode), so do what Linux arm-smmu-qcom.c does for its bypass
+ * quirk: route the stream to the last context bank, programmed as stage-1
+ * translate / stage-2 bypass with SCTLR.M = 0 (no stage-1 translation).
+ * Nothing is accepted without reading the registers back: on any mismatch
+ * the stream entry is removed again and no DMA is started.
  */
